DIAGNOSTICS
.in +5
.br
Errors name the file and line they were found on and are written to
standard error.  The exit status is non-zero if any were reported.


.in -5
.bd
NOTES
.in +5
.br
The program is built under the name
.bd
cpp
and installed as
.bd
pass0,
which is the name the driver runs it by.  It is the first pass rather
than a preprocessor, and the name says so.
